Everything originally in this model should NEVER be renamed and remain where it is

Instructions:

>	Only do these things in Edit mode on ROBLOX Studio
	>	Build your plane and put the parts into the OtherParts model. You can delete any other parts currently in the OtherParts model
	>	Read the README script inside the EDIT_THESE object. This will tell you what each item does
	>	Edit values in EDIT_THESE object to adjust the plane to your likings
	>	Making Landing Gear
		>	Place landing gear items into LandingGear models located in Plane > MainParts. A sample is given, but you can delete it and make your own
	>	This kit is specially made so you do NOT have to script anything

*******************************
NOTE: ALL PARTS MUST BE ANCHORED

	This helps the welding system be
	effective. This also means that
	you can use CFrame editing on the
	plane and the plane will still work.
*******************************


Troubleshooting:

	If the plane does not work, make sure that you have the original plane kit
	from crazyman32 and that you have not renamed any of the original objects
	inside the plane. If this does not fix the plane, start over from scratch.

	NOTE: If you start over again, make sure to save the parts from the OtherParts
	model. Items in that model will not cause the model to break, therefore will
	never be the issue (unless you have placed malicious scripts there)


Purpose:

	This plane was designed so people can easily edit and design their plane with NO
	scripting whatsoever. The goal of this model is to increase the quality of planes
	in games. Therefore, this model was created to be as simple as possible, but still
	allow users to have a large field to edit settings (EDIT_THESE object).


